/// A FLOW: one row per event that moved the receivable, 246,040 of them, signed so a waterfall reads without a sign convention in DAX. With the snapshot it closes an identity in every month - AR(m) = AR(m-1) + submitted - collected - patient responsibility - denied. A snapshot alone can drift unnoticed; a ledger alone cannot be aged.
